sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application Pods
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>4317/TCP gRPC, 4318/TCP HTTP
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>(MonitoringStack)<br/>8889/TCP HTTPS
    participant Thanos as Thanos Querier<br/>10902/TCP HTTP
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PLP as prom-label-proxy<br/>9091/TCP HTTP
    participant User as Dashboard User
    participant Tempo as Tempo<br/>4317/TCP gRPC
    participant KubeAPI as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as odh-observability Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over App,PLP: Flow 1: Metrics Collection and Querying

    App->>OTel: OTLP metrics<br/>4317/TCP gRPC or 4318/TCP HTTP<br/>TLS
    OTel->>Prom: Prometheus scrape<br/>8889/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS (service-CA)
    Prom->>Thanos: Sidecar sync<br/>10902/TCP HTTP<br/>loopback

    User->>Route: Query metrics<br/>443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Bearer token
    Route->>KRBAC: Forward<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS (service-CA)
    KRBAC->>KRBAC: SubjectAccessReview<br/>RBAC check
    KRBAC->>PLP: Forward<br/>9091/TCP HTTP<br/>loopback
    PLP->>PLP: Namespace label enforcement<br/>regex match
    PLP->>Thanos: Scoped query<br/>10902/TCP HTTP<br/>loopback
    Thanos-->>PLP: Query results
    PLP-->>KRBAC: Scoped results
    KRBAC-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>User: JSON metrics

    Note over App,Tempo: Flow 2: Distributed Tracing

    App->>OTel: OTLP traces<br/>4317/TCP gRPC<br/>TLS
    OTel->>Tempo: Forward traces<br/>4317/TCP gRPC OTLP<br/>Configurable TLS<br/>tempo.grafana.com RBAC

    Note over KubeAPI,Webhook: Flow 3: Webhook Label Injection

    KubeAPI->>Webhook: Admission request<br/>(PodMonitor/ServiceMonitor)<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS (cert-manager)
    Webhook->>KubeAPI: Namespace lookup + Monitoring CR check<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS<br/>SA token
    Webhook-->>KubeAPI: Admission response<br/>(patch: add scrape label)
